{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/al-jawahara-tower-tiger-group-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":414,"crm_id":"1753","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Al Jawahara Tower","slug":"al-jawahara-tower-tiger-group-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT)","building_type":["studio","apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Tiger Group","price":620000,"display_price":"620K","lattitude":25.0363564227154,"longitude":55.17691950474797,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"TBA","about":"<p>Al Jawhara Tower is a modern residential building, which is a 36-storey skyscraper developed by developer Tiger Properties. This project combines elegant design, high quality materials and innovative technology to create a luxurious living experience.</p><p>The complex is located in the attractive Jumeirah Village Triangle neighbourhood with developed infrastructure, making it an ideal place for comfortable living. Residents here can enjoy spectacular views of the city, ocean and surrounding attractions.</p><p>Inside, the building provides spacious and <strong>stylish studios</strong> with functional layouts equipped with modern amenities. Residents of Al Jawhara Tower can enjoy a wide range of amenities such as a fitness centre, swimming pool, multi-sports courts, parking and 24-hour CCTV security.</p><p>With the development's location close to Dubai's main motorways, residents have quick access to key points in the city. Palm Jumeirah and The Walk JBR are just 15 minutes away, while Burj Al Arab, Dubai Mall and Al Maktoum International Airport are all within a 20-25 minute drive. Dubai International Airport is approximately 30 minutes' drive away.</p><p>Al Jawhara Tower provides residents with a comfortable lifestyle in the h